{"ts":"2026-07-27T15:23:59.903Z","author":"claude-code","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"6ff7a19f0fde28814757fa94","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-graph-vgj0"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Cover the output_format decline contract with real SDK harness tests instead of a registration-only assertion"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The existing export-and-contract test asserted only that registerService was called for output_format, using a hand-rolled api double with an as any cast. That can never observe the override's RETURN value, which is exactly what regressed under pm-cli 2026.7.27: an override's bare return IS what the host renders, so the previous decline path returning ctx.payload made every command print the whole command context. Added two cases through createExtensionTestHarness plus runRegisteredServiceOverrideForTest: an unrelated command payload must be declined with handled false, the payload returned untouched and no service-override warnings, and a pm-graph export raw-output payload must still be claimed verbatim. Suite is 97 pass 0 fail. Filed upstream as unbraind/pm-cli#776."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":[]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-27T15:23:59.903Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-27T15:23:59.903Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"claude-code"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"cb6a4438e0b25ba8637c25d6c8c611d184ff0f726e9b7557a29e4a68db64499d","message":""}
